485 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 407 0 R
/E (In the commercial space age, space travel is becoming more affordable. Space X is a leading company in this industry that leverages the first stage of rocket launches, specifically the Falcon 9, to make space travel affordable. The aim is to make Space Y a competitive company by determining the price of each launch. In order to achieve this, information from Space X rocket launches will be gathered to train a machine learning model that will predict whether the first stage of the rocket launch will be successful or not.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
